flowchart TD
    A[FASTQ R1/R2<br/>per-lane] --> B[BWA-MEM2<br/>per-lane align<br/>RG: SM/LB/PL/PU]
    B --> C[samtools sort + index]
    C --> D[samtools merge<br/>lane BAMs]
    D --> E[Picard MarkDuplicates]
    E --> F{BQSR?}
    F -- yes --> G[GATK BaseRecalibrator<br/>+ ApplyBQSR]
    F -- no --> H[Analysis-ready BAM]
    G --> H
    H --> I1[GATK HaplotypeCaller]
    H --> I2[DeepVariant<br/>WES model]
    H --> I3[Strelka2<br/>--exome]
    H --> I4[bcftools mpileup<br/>+ call -m]
    H --> I5[FreeBayes<br/>parallel]
    I1 --> J[Per-caller VCF<br/>normalised, bgzipped]
    I2 --> J
    I3 --> J
    I4 --> J
    I5 --> J
    J --> K[Eval region:<br/>AgilentV5 ∩ GIAB-HC]
    K --> L1[hap.py]
    K --> L2[RTG vcfeval]
    L1 --> M[aggregate_results.py]
    L2 --> M
    M --> N[summary.tsv<br/>+ pr_curve.png]
